{"id":236,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"力の教育を基盤に探究・DX・高大連携を進める","feature_description":"帝塚山は知・情・意・体の調和を目指す「力の教育」を基盤に、個性と人間力を育てます。中高一貫の六年間を生かした独自プログラムを中学１年から開始し、進路目標に応じた指導を行います。探究型学習やICT教育を通して、答えのない問いに向き合い、協働して課題を解決する力を養成。大学との連携講座や研究者との交流も設けています。授業は原則として男女別に行い、クラブ活動や学校行事は男女ともに取り組みます。","clubs":[{"id":5083,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5084,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5085,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5086,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5087,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5088,"name":"山岳部・野外活動部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5089,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5090,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5092,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5093,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5096,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5097,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.jp/seikatu/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5098,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tezukayama-h.ed.